│ were included; further relevant articles were also identified and included as appropriate. RESULTS Seventeen studies │
│ were identified and included: 12 RCTs and one non-randomized study of pre-insertion oral analgesia, cervical priming │
│ and local anaesthesia; one systematic review and one RCT on post-insertion analgesia and two non-randomized studies  │
