│ hysteroscopy or abortion and effectiveness in specific subsets of women has not been studied adequately. A           │
│ systematic review found non-steroidal anti-inflammatory agents (NSAID) to be effective in reactively treating        │
│ post-insertion pain, but no benefit was found with prophylactic use. CONCLUSIONS No prophylactic pharmacological     │
